        "help": "Compacts the pkm database file. Removing packages and collapsing duplicated records leave unused pages inside the file; the database reuses them but does not hand them back to the filesystem until it is rebuilt. This rewrites the database into a new file and swaps it in, which needs free disk space of about twice the current file size while both exist \u2014 so it checks for that space first and refuses rather than running out partway. Nothing runs this automatically. No installed file is touched and no package record changes."
